#: ../../source/docs/hitl-simulators.rst:9 9649c38971e243d39149b23740217d96
msgid ""
"Hardware In The Loop (HITL) simulation replaces the vehicle and the "
"environment with a simulator (the Simulator has a high-fidelity aircraft "
"dynamics model and environment model for wind, turbulence, etc.) The "
"physical AutoPilot hardware is configured exactly as for flight, and "
"connects to your computer running the simulator (rather than the aircraft)."
msgstr ""
"硬件在环（HITL）仿真使用仿真器替代飞行器和环境（仿真器具有高保真飞行器动力学模型以及风、湍流等环境模型）。物理自动驾驶仪硬件按照实际飞行配置，并连接到运行仿真器的计算机（而非飞行器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hitl-simulators.rst:16 a8bfb42559c04485ac45f1c7db73a9e8
msgid "This section contains HITL simulation solutions."
msgstr "本节包含 HITL 仿真解决方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/hitl-simulators.rst:20 91fa8b3c46c445a5a664045baf306302
msgid ""
"At time of writing X-Plane and Flightgear simulation for ArduPilot only "
"support Plane (not Copter or Rover)."
msgstr "截至撰写时，ArduPilot 的 X-Plane 和 FlightGear 仿真仅支持固定翼（不支持 Copter 或 Rover）。"
